Help tasks
----------
artifactTransforms - Displays the Artifact Transforms that can be executed in project ':app'.
buildEnvironment - Displays all buildscript dependencies declared in project ':app'.
dependencies - Displays all dependencies declared in project ':app'.
dependencyInsight - Displays the insight into a specific dependency in project ':app'.
help - Displays a help message.
javaToolchains - Displays the detected java toolchains.
kotlinDslAccessorsReport - Prints the Kotlin code for accessing the currently available project extensions.
outgoingVariants - Displays the outgoing variants of project ':app'.
projects - Displays the sub-projects of project ':app'.
properties - Displays the properties of project ':app'.
resolvableConfigurations - Displays the configurations that can be resolved in project ':app'.
tasks - Displays the tasks runnable from project ':app'.

Install tasks
-------------
installFreeProductionDebug - Installs the Debug build for flavor FreeProduction.
installFreeProductionDebugAndroidTest - Installs the android (on device) tests for the FreeProductionDebug build.
installFreeStagingDebug - Installs the Debug build for flavor FreeStaging.
installFreeStagingDebugAndroidTest - Installs the android (on device) tests for the FreeStagingDebug build.
installFreeTrialProductionDebug - Installs the Debug build for flavor FreeTrialProduction.
installFreeTrialProductionDebugAndroidTest - Installs the android (on device) tests for the FreeTrialProductionDebug build.
installFreeTrialStagingDebug - Installs the Debug build for flavor FreeTrialStaging.
installFreeTrialStagingDebugAndroidTest - Installs the android (on device) tests for the FreeTrialStagingDebug build.
uninstallAll - Uninstall all applications.
uninstallFreeProductionDebug - Uninstalls the Debug build for flavor FreeProduction.
uninstallFreeProductionDebugAndroidTest - Uninstalls the android (on device) tests for the FreeProductionDebug build.
uninstallFreeProductionRelease - Uninstalls the Release build for flavor FreeProduction.
uninstallFreeStagingDebug - Uninstalls the Debug build for flavor FreeStaging.
uninstallFreeStagingDebugAndroidTest - Uninstalls the android (on device) tests for the FreeStagingDebug build.
uninstallFreeStagingRelease - Uninstalls the Release build for flavor FreeStaging.
uninstallFreeTrialProductionDebug - Uninstalls the Debug build for flavor FreeTrialProduction.
uninstallFreeTrialProductionDebugAndroidTest - Uninstalls the android (on device) tests for the FreeTrialProductionDebug build.
uninstallFreeTrialProductionRelease - Uninstalls the Release build for flavor FreeTrialProduction.
uninstallFreeTrialStagingDebug - Uninstalls the Debug build for flavor FreeTrialStaging.
uninstallFreeTrialStagingDebugAndroidTest - Uninstalls the android (on device) tests for the FreeTrialStagingDebug build.
uninstallFreeTrialStagingRelease - Uninstalls the Release build for flavor FreeTrialStaging.

Verification tasks
------------------
check - Runs all checks.
checkJetifier - Checks whether Jetifier is needed for the current project
connectedAndroidTest - Installs and runs instrumentation tests for all flavors on connected devices.
connectedCheck - Runs all device checks on currently connected devices.
connectedFreeProductionDebugAndroidTest - Installs and runs the tests for freeProductionDebug on connected devices.
connectedFreeStagingDebugAndroidTest - Installs and runs the tests for freeStagingDebug on connected devices.
connectedFreeTrialProductionDebugAndroidTest - Installs and runs the tests for freeTrialProductionDebug on connected devices.
connectedFreeTrialStagingDebugAndroidTest - Installs and runs the tests for freeTrialStagingDebug on connected devices.
deviceAndroidTest - Installs and runs instrumentation tests using all Device Providers.
deviceCheck - Runs all device checks using Device Providers and Test Servers.
lint - Runs lint on the default variant.
lintFix - Runs lint on the default variant and applies any safe suggestions to the source code.
lintFreeProductionDebug - Print text output from the corresponding lint report task
lintFreeProductionRelease - Print text output from the corresponding lint report task
lintFreeStagingDebug - Print text output from the corresponding lint report task
lintFreeStagingRelease - Print text output from the corresponding lint report task
lintFreeTrialProductionDebug - Print text output from the corresponding lint report task
lintFreeTrialProductionRelease - Print text output from the corresponding lint report task
lintFreeTrialStagingDebug - Print text output from the corresponding lint report task
lintFreeTrialStagingRelease - Print text output from the corresponding lint report task
lintVitalFreeProductionRelease - Print text output from the corresponding lint report task
lintVitalFreeStagingRelease - Print text output from the corresponding lint report task
lintVitalFreeTrialProductionRelease - Print text output from the corresponding lint report task
lintVitalFreeTrialStagingRelease - Print text output from the corresponding lint report task
test - Run unit tests for all variants.
testFreeProductionDebugUnitTest - Run unit tests for the freeProductionDebug build.
testFreeStagingDebugUnitTest - Run unit tests for the freeStagingDebug build.
testFreeTrialProductionDebugUnitTest - Run unit tests for the freeTrialProductionDebug build.
testFreeTrialStagingDebugUnitTest - Run unit tests for the freeTrialStagingDebug build.
updateLintBaseline - Updates the lint baseline using the default variant.

